# @superagent-flow v1
# when 来源收到点名 agent 的请求（GitHub 评论 / 飞书群提及）
# goal 产出可审阅结果并回写来源会话，或明确拒绝后沉默
# budget 准入1 执行3轮 每轮工具<=40

admit          : deny -> quiet
open-ticket
checkout
dispatch
work           : blocked -> escalate (max 3)
verify         : fail -> work (max 2)
?handoff
deliver        : pr-ready -> open-pr
open-pr
reply
close
quiet
escalate
